  "description": "Nalix.Network.Pipeline provides reusable middleware, throttling, and timekeeping components for the Nalix networking stack. It includes inbound packet middleware for permissions, rate limiting, concurrency control, and timeout handling, along with supporting primitives for traffic shaping and clock coordination.\n\nThis package is intended for applications and infrastructure that want finer control over request processing pipelines without taking a dependency on the full networking runtime surface.",
  "iconFile": "nalix.png",
