  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Adaptive Traffic Shaping: Robust Token Bucket and Policy-based rate limiters to protect critical network boundaries from traffic bursts.\n- Middleware Defense: High-efficiency inbound filters for permission validation, concurrency gating, and automated timeout enforcement.\n- Temporal Accuracy: Integrated TimeSynchronizer for precise, high-resolution clock coordination in distributed networking environments.\n- Modular Integration: Decoupled pipeline and throttling primitives that can be used independently from the core transport runtime.",
